{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>潘靜文（Sherman）在TVB節目《愛‧回家之三代同糖》以全新「社恐四眼妹」造型登場，一副黑色圓形粗框眼鏡，加上連環放送的可愛表情包，竟意外獲得網民洗版式激讚！不少人更指其造型與動畫角色「阿愁」有驚人相似度，監製更爆料指新形象令她「完全變咗第二個人」，究竟這個造型有何魔力？</p><p>潘靜文變身社恐四眼妹 Cute爆表情包逐個睇</p><p>在劇中，潘靜文飾演性格內向、無厘神氣又缺乏自信的「社恐四眼妹」莫希靈。她全新的黑色圓形粗框眼鏡造型相當討喜，成功塑造出角色的神髓。Sherman在劇中更展現了多款可愛表情，不論是Cute到爆的傻樣、開心樣、嘟嘴樣，還是充滿負能量的放負樣，都演繹得淋漓盡致，完全俘虜了觀眾的心，為角色注入了生命力。</p><p>監製爆改造內幕 Sherman自爆冇人認得</p><p>對於Sherman的全新形象，監製Marco受訪時透露了背後的巧思。他表示，為了增加角色的整體特色，在試造型時特意為Sherman挑選了一副圓框粗邊眼鏡，結果效果出奇地好，成功將Sherman改頭換面。Marco更笑言這個造型非常成功，並引述Sherman的反應：「Sherman 同我講周圍嘅人都唔認得佢，完全變咗第二個人。」可見這次形象改造為她帶來了極大的新鮮感和突破。</p><p>網民洗版式大讚可愛 直指神還原「阿愁」</p><p>劇集播出後，網民對潘靜文的新造型反應極為熱烈，在討論區洗版式大讚可愛。不少留言都指這個造型非常適合她，紛紛表示：「莫希靈好可愛」、「呢個造型最好睇」。更有眼利網民發現，Sherman的「四眼妹」造型，尤其是她的放負表情，與動畫《玩轉腦朋友》中的角色「阿愁」有幾分相似，大讚她「神還原阿愁」！有網民留言：「Sherman呢個look好有驚喜，同平時好唔同！」、「個角色好得意，個眼鏡係靈魂！」、「真係好似阿愁，特別係個放負樣，哈哈！」</p><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/01a_17866368216a87debb6fdbc.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/01_2230897886a87debf748ee.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/02_728159256a87ded139a36.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/03_12276908956a87dee391645.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/04_5616537746a87def8db987.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/05_6095267626a87df065041e.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/06_21214707526a87df21072dd.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/07_7136958016a87df2c814fa.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/08_18238282186a87df3313d78.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/09_9113061726a87e070a18bb.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/10_4949501096a87e07434fc0.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/11_13441325346a87e085d807d.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/12_6482607556a87e093169e9.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/13_5806432336a87e0a1a0207.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/14_1226445226a87e0aedd018.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/15_9463185566a87e0b279f2d.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/16a_15526035846a87e0b615d04.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/16_20163018536a87e0b9952e0.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/17_15656907226a87e0bddcfe6.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/18_18857525376a87e0ca06358.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/19_8005172926a87e0df7990d.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</fig